"""Hand-written one-line descriptions for every FR33THY Ultimate script.

Keyed by script path ("<folder>/<file>.ps1"). The catalog generator merges
these into tweaks.json as each tweak's "description"; scripts missing here
fall back to an empty description, and the count check in catalog_gen.py
fails the build of the catalog if coverage drops, so new upstream scripts
get noticed.
"""

